# Digests of the pre-existing imperative CI estate. ISC-203, ISC-278..280:
# the terraform work is a SIBLING of these scripts and may never edit them.
#
#
# A mismatch means one of two things, and they need different responses:
#   1. Terraform work edited a frozen script -> revert it, the guard did its job.
#   2. Unrelated CI work legitimately changed it -> confirm the change came from
#      outside the terraform tree, then re-record HERE with the new commit.
# Never re-record to make a red guard green without establishing which case it is.
